{"title":"success","message":"Properties found successfully","properties":[{"PropertyId":375,"AccommodationSetting":[{"id":48,"commission_level":15,"markup_level":0,"commission_level_type":"%","deposits_enabled":true,"first_night_fee":"no","night_fee_value":1,"percentage_value":false,"deposit_amount_per_room":25,"min_deposit_jpy":0,"days_in_advance":70,"description":null,"taxes_fees":0,"price_mode":"","price":0,"allow_pro_rata_pricing":false,"duration_nights":0,"maximum_quantity":0,"refundable_type":"percentage","refundable_value":0,"refundable_min_days":0,"date_rules":[{"check_in":"","check_out":"","fixed_date":"","selected_type":"balance_due","balance_due_days":70,"due_on_confirm_booking":null}],"is_fixed_date_enabled":false,"fixed_deadline_date":null,"due_on_confirm_booking_date":null,"due_on_confirm_booking":"no","created_at":"2026-01-29T13:17:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T12:37:59.000000Z","pivot":{"supplier_id":46,"accommodation_setting_id":48}}],"SupplierPaymentTerms":{"isDeposit":true,"isPercentage":true,"depositPercentage":25,"depositType":"deposit","depositAmount":0,"balanceDueAmount":0,"daysInAdv":70,"daysInAdvDate":null,"isFixedDate":false,"fixedDueDate":null,"balanceDueDate":null,"date_rules":[{"check_in":null,"check_out":null,"fixed_date":null,"selected_type":"balance_due","balance_due_days":70,"due_on_confirm_booking":null}]},"PropertyRoomBossHotelId":null,"PropertyName":"Solar Chalets","ClientPropertyName":"Solar Chalets","PropertyDescription":"<p>Hakuba Solar Chalets are smart, contemporary-style 3 Bedroom 125 sqm&nbsp;chalets set over 2 stories, perfect for families or groups of friends looking for that perfect ski holiday. Set in the tranquil and beautiful neighborhood of Wadano Forest, the property\u2019s prime location boasts quick access to Hakuba Happo One\u2019s Sakka Ski Slope. Enjoy the open-plan layout of the lounge, dining and kitchen while taking in the relaxing forest and ski slope views. Hakuba Solar Chalets is well equipped with luxury amenities including large flat screen LCD TV, free wireless broadband internet, Apple TV with&nbsp;Netflix, sound dock, hydronic under floor heating and your very own&nbsp;drying room.<\/p><p>Complimentary selection of tea, coffee, milk, sugar, washing &amp; dishwasher powder on arrival. Concierge services are provided from the sister hotel located 250 meters away.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">A discount may be applicable for your dates. Please enquire to confirm.<\/span><\/p>","PropertyClientDescription":"","PropertyBedBankDesc":"<p>Hakuba Solar Chalets are smart, contemporary-style 3 Bedroom 125 sqm&nbsp;chalets set over 2 stories, perfect for families or groups of friends looking for that perfect ski holiday. Set in the tranquil and beautiful neighborhood of Wadano Forest, the property\u2019s prime location boasts quick access to Hakuba Happo One\u2019s Sakka Ski Slope. Enjoy the open-plan layout of the lounge, dining and kitchen while taking in the relaxing forest and ski slope views. Hakuba Solar Chalets is well equipped with luxury amenities including large flat screen LCD TV, free wireless broadband internet, Apple TV with&nbsp;Netflix, sound dock, hydronic under floor heating and your very own&nbsp;drying room.<\/p><p>Complimentary selection of tea, coffee, milk, sugar, washing &amp; dishwasher powder on arrival. Concierge services are provided from the sister hotel located 250 meters away.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">A discount may be applicable for your dates. Please enquire to confirm.<\/span><\/p>","PropertyCountry":"Japan","NoOfRooms":null,"AddressOne":"4860-7 Hokuj\u014d, Hakuba, Kitaazumi District, Kitaazumi District, Nagano 399-9301","LinkWithRB":false,"LiftAccessInfo":"Walk to Sakka slope:\u00a0 5 minutes | Walk to Shuttle: 10 minutes","LocationInfo":"Hakuba Solar Chalets are located in a quiet part of the upper Wadano neighborhood, one of Hakuba\u2019s most popular locations. With excellent easy walking distance to the spectacular slopes of Happo One, here you will also find a nice selection of restaurants, bars and other amenities, including Central Snowsports rental shop and the wonderful Azekura onsen, which is available to rent privately. Upper Wadano sits at the base of Happo One, the largest of Hakuba\u2019s 10 ski areas. This location offers unparalleled access to the Happo One ski lifts at the Sakka base area, which is ideal for beginners and experts alike. With wide and gentle beginner slopes, a kids snow park and easy access to the Evergreen International Ski School, Upper Wadano is an ideal location for families. For more advanced skiers, the Sakka lift base area offers quick and easy access to Happo One\u2019s upper slopes via the high speed Sakka quad lift.\n\nOther resorts in the Hakuba Valley can be accessed easily via the free shuttle buses which stop in various locations throughout Upper Wadano. The nearest ski lift access point are the Sakka chair lifts, located just a 2 minute walk away. The Kokusai lift point and ADAM Gondola Station are just 2-5 minutes away by car. Various shuttles for accessing other resort areas are also within 1-5 minute walking distance from the chalets.\n\nSolar Chalet guests will also receive complimentary scheduled shuttles to select lifts, the Happo Bus Terminal and Hakuba Station, daily supermarket shuttles, as well as shuttle service to Hakuba Hospitality Group Restaurants.","ResortName":"Hakuba","ResortShortCode":"HKB","PropertyType":"chalet","PropertySubType":"bedbank","NoOfBedRooms":"","MaxChildAge":"","Units":[{"Unit":1,"Adults":2,"Children":0,"Infants":0,"Rooms":[{"RoomId":"20260724122126983","ActualRoomId":912,"DBRoomId":912,"RoomName":"3 Bedroom Chalet","RoomDescription":"3 Bedroom Chalet Features: 125 sqm chalet consisting of a master bedroom with ensuite bathroom, and 2 bedrooms on the first floor. Laundry room complete with washer and dryer + dry room, and a second full bathroom is also located on the 1st floor. Living, dining and fully equipped kitchen including dish washer and oven are located on the 2nd floor. Comfortably sleeps up to 8 people.","BedBankDesc":"3 Bedroom Chalet Features: 125 sqm chalet consisting of a master bedroom with ensuite bathroom, and 2 bedrooms on the first floor. Laundry room complete with washer and dryer + dry room, and a second full bathroom is also located on the 1st floor. Living, dining and fully equipped kitchen including dish washer and oven are located on the 2nd floor. Comfortably sleeps up to 8 people.","ClientRoomName":"","ClientRoomDescription":"","RoomImages":[{"id":3338,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"89118.webp","extension":"webp"},{"id":3343,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"89122.webp","extension":"webp"},{"id":3339,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"89119.webp","extension":"webp"},{"id":3344,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"89124.webp","extension":"webp"},{"id":9103,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"solar_chalet_23-min.jpg","extension":"jpg"},{"id":9104,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"solar_chalet_999-min.jpg","extension":"jpg"},{"id":9090,"path":"\/photos\/1\/Solar Chalets\/","file_name":"82220.webp","extension":"webp"}],"Infants":0,"AdditionalChildren":0,"AdditionalInfants":0,"Facilities":{"name":"Unit Facilities","options":[{"id":289,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-kitchen-set\"><\/i>","name":"Full Kitchen","checked":true},{"id":296,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bath\"><\/i>","name":"Bath","checked":true},{"id":33,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-fire-burner\"><\/i>","name":"Microwave","checked":true},{"id":308,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-temperature-high\"><\/i>","name":"Heated floors","checked":true},{"id":57,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-tv\"><\/i>","name":"Flat Screen TV","checked":true},{"id":32,"icon":"<i class=\"fa-solid fa-snowflake\"><\/i>","name":"Fridge","checked":true},{"id":20,"icon":"<i class=\"fa