oncierge,&nbsp;ski valet,&nbsp;natural&nbsp;<\/span><em style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">onsen<\/em><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;hot springs, private family&nbsp;<\/span><em style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">onsens<\/em><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">, spa and massage, gym, restaurant, bar, art gallery,&nbsp;craft shop, kid\u2019s club, ski school, conference room and more.qwerty<\/span><\/p>","PropertyBedBankDesc":null,"PropertyCountry":"Japan","NoOfRooms":null,"AddressOne":"4-ch\u014dme-4-5 Nisekohirafu 1 J\u014d, Kutchan, Abuta District, Hokkaido 044-0080, Japan","LinkWithRB":true,"LiftAccessInfo":"Ski in Ski out of Ace Family Lift (please check lift operation during off-peak).","LocationInfo":"AYA Niseko proudly sits at the base of one of Grand Hirafu\u2019s most popular ski runs, providing an unparalleled ski in ski out experience during winter. This superb location means that your Niseko Japan accommodation is never more than minutes away from any of Hirafu\u2019s award-winning restaurants, bars and shops, making it the perfect Niseko hotel. After a day skiing, simply ski in and drop your equipment with the ski valet for an evening of private outdoor onsen and dining within AYA complex, or take a short stroll into the heart of Hirafu village to dine out.","ResortName":"Niseko","ResortShortCode":"NSK","PropertyType":"hotel","PropertySubType":"roomboss","NoOfBedRooms":"","MaxChildAge":"","Units":[{"Unit":1,"Adults":1,"Children":0,"Infants":0,"Rooms":[{"RoomId":"20260724130100895","ActualRoomId":"2c98902a50a6076e0150b72b40126f67","DBRoomId":3,"RoomName":"Studio Village View","RoomDescription":"2~6th Flr. 47 sqm. Up to 3 ppl ( 7 years old and up ). Sofa-bed for 3rd person.  Ensuite bathroom includes shower (no bathtub). Modern studio overlooking the town. Custom furnished, w\/ plentiful s